{"seq":1,"slug":"procedural-scattering","title":"程序化散布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/practice/procedural-scattering","wordCount":1695,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"程序化散布\">程序化散布</h1><p>前三章教会你如何高效地画、让它动、让它透光，但还没回答最前面的问题：这几十万株草木从哪来、该放到哪去？没人会手工摆一片森林。散布（scattering）是把植被按生态规律、密度分布和地形约束自动放置到世界里的过程——它决定了草木的位置、朝向、缩放、色变这些 per-instance 数据从何而来。这一篇讲散布的方法与约束，并划清它与 <a href=\"../game-terrain-systems/foundations/terrain-pipeline\">地形系统</a> 和 PCG 工具链的分工。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从密度到具体的点\">核心概念：从密度到具体的点</h2><p>散布本质是个采样问题：给定「哪里该多长、哪里该少长」的密度场，采出一组既符合密度又分布自然的具体位置，再对每个位置施加地形约束和生态规则，最后附上随机化的实例属性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[密度贴图/生态图] --&gt; B[采样候选点&lt;br/&gt;Poisson 盘/抖动网格]&#10;  B --&gt; C[地形约束过滤&lt;br/&gt;坡度/高度/水/道路]&#10;  C --&gt; D[生态群落规则&lt;br/&gt;物种共生/竞争]&#10;  D --&gt; E[对齐地表&lt;br/&gt;贴地+法线对齐]&#10;  E --&gt; F[随机化实例属性&lt;br/&gt;旋转/缩放/色变/风相位]&#10;  F --&gt; G[写入 per-instance 缓冲]\">flowchart TD\n  A[密度贴图/生态图] --&gt; B[采样候选点&lt;br/&gt;Poisson 盘/抖动网格]\n  B --&gt; C[地形约束过滤&lt;br/&gt;坡度/高度/水/道路]\n  C --&gt; D[生态群落规则&lt;br/&gt;物种共生/竞争]\n  D --&gt; E[对齐地表&lt;br/&gt;贴地+法线对齐]\n  E --&gt; F[随机化实例属性&lt;br/&gt;旋转/缩放/色变/风相位]\n  F --&gt; G[写入 per-instance 缓冲]</pre><p>下表对比几种采样策略，从最粗到最自然。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采样策略</th>\n<th>分布特征</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则网格</td>\n<td>死板、有栅格感</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>农田/人造林</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抖动网格（jittered）</td>\n<td>半随机、无重叠保证</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>一般草地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poisson 盘采样</td>\n<td>有最小间距、自然</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>自然植被主流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态模拟</td>\n<td>物种竞争涌现</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高保真/离线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"密度场-哪里该长多少\">密度场：哪里该长多少</h2><p>散布的输入是密度——一张（或几张）标出每处植被数量的场。它可以来自手绘的密度贴图（技术美术刷出森林边界、草地浓淡），来自程序化噪声（用分形噪声生成自然的疏密斑块，噪声原理见 <a href=\"../procedural-content-generation/foundations/randomness-noise\">随机与噪声</a>），或来自生态图（把湿度、海拔、光照映射成不同物种的适生度）。多物种时每种植被各有一张密度场，湿地图偏芦苇、坡地图偏灌木，叠起来就是一片有生态层次的植被。</p>\n<p>密度场还承担大尺度的色彩与形态渐变——同一片草，向阳坡偏黄、背阴谷偏绿，这个生态渐变叠在 per-instance 随机色变之上，共同兑现 <a href=\"../foundations/vegetation-components\">植被视觉成分</a> 要求的色彩离散。密度不是常数而是随环境连续变化，是散布看起来「自然」而非「铺地毯」的第一要素。</p>\n<h2 id=\"poisson-盘采样-让点既随机又不打架\">Poisson 盘采样：让点既随机又不打架</h2><p>有了密度还要采点。最朴素的规则网格一眼假，纯随机又会让点扎堆重叠。自然植被的黄金标准是 Poisson 盘采样（Poisson-disk sampling）：它保证任意两点间距不小于半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，于是点既随机又均匀铺开，像真实草木争夺空间后的分布。</p>\n<p>经典的 Bridson 算法用一个背景网格加速：每采一个新点就检查其半径邻域内是否已有点，无则接受。要让密度随位置变化，把半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 做成密度的函数——密处 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 小、点密，疏处 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 大、点疏。半径与局部密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(\\vec{p}) = \\sqrt{\\frac{k}{\\rho(\\vec{p})}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.1884em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8516em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8116em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1884em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是与目标覆盖率相关的常数。工程上超大世界不会全局跑 Poisson，而是分块（tile）采样并保证块边界间距一致，配合流送按需生成（跨到开放世界的分块流送，见 <a href=\"../game-streaming-open-world/continuity/seamless-transitions\">无缝过渡</a>）。一个务实简化是「抖动网格」——规则网格每格随机抖动点位，成本远低于 Poisson，视觉在草这种高密度场景里也够用，Poisson 留给稀疏的乔木灌木。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地形约束-坡度-高度-道路-水\">地形约束：坡度、高度、道路、水</h2><p>采出的候选点还要过一道约束过滤，因为不是每处都该长草。常见约束有四类：坡度约束（太陡的岩壁不长草，用地表法线与竖直方向夹角判定）；高度约束（雪线以上、水面以下不长）；排除遮罩（道路、建筑、河流的占位区要剔除植被，用一张遮罩贴图标出禁区）；以及与地表的对齐——每株草要贴合地面高度、并按局部法线倾斜（草在陡坡上应略微顺坡而非直插）。</p>\n<p>这些约束的数据大多来自地形——高度场、法线、材质权重、道路网络都是地形系统产出的（见 <a href=\"../game-terrain-systems/foundations/terrain-pipeline\">地形管线</a>）。这就引出本 hub 与地形 hub 的分工边界：地形侧的 <a href=\"../game-terrain-systems/shading/vegetation-scattering\">植被散布</a> 讲的是从地形视角如何在地表撒点、如何与地表材质耦合；本篇讲的是植被视角的完整散布策略——采样算法、生态规则、per-instance 属性生成。两者互补，别在错的 hub 找内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生态规则与实例属性\">生态规则与实例属性</h2><p>高保真散布不止「撒点」，还有生态涌现。物种之间有共生与竞争：大树周围一圈是它的树荫，草在树荫下变稀；先锋物种占据开阔地，演替物种在其后跟进；同种之间保持最小间距（这正是 Poisson 半径的生态含义）。把这些规则编码进散布，森林就有了层次而非均匀铺满。</p>\n<p>最后一步是给每株附上随机化的实例属性：随机旋转（破除朝向一致的阵列感）、随机缩放（大小参差）、随机色变（喂给着色）、随机风相位（喂给 <a href=\"../animation/wind-animation\">风动动画</a> 让每株不同步）。这些属性写进 per-instance 缓冲，正是 <a href=\"../rendering/instancing-batching\">实例化与批处理</a> 消费的那份数据。散布因此是整个植被管线的「源头」——它生产的每一条实例数据，都会流经渲染、动画、LOD 各章。这类程序化生成的可控性与评估，属于 PCG 的通用方法论，见 <a href=\"../procedural-content-generation/foundations/controllability-evaluation\">可控性与评估</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>散布是把密度场采样成具体位置、再施加约束和生态规则、最后附上实例属性的过程，是植被管线的数据源头。</li>\n<li>密度来自手绘贴图、程序化噪声或生态图；多物种各有密度场，叠出生态层次，并承载大尺度色彩渐变。</li>\n<li>Poisson 盘采样保证最小间距，让点既随机又不扎堆，半径随密度变化；超大世界分块采样，草可用更省的抖动网格。</li>\n<li>地形约束（坡度、高度、道路/水排除、贴地对齐）的数据来自地形系统；地形 hub 讲地表视角撒点，本篇讲植被视角完整策略。</li>\n<li>生态规则带来物种共生竞争的涌现；每株的随机旋转/缩放/色变/风相位写进 per-instance 缓冲，供后续各章消费。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：散布产出的实例数据被 <a href=\"../rendering/instancing-batching\">实例化与批处理</a> 消费；随机风相位供 <a href=\"../animation/wind-animation\">风动动画</a> 使用；色彩离散的验收见 <a href=\"../foundations/vegetation-components\">植被视觉成分</a>；分布随距离的密度衰减归 <a href=\"vegetation-lod\">植被 LOD</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：从地形视角的撒点见 <a href=\"../game-terrain-systems/shading/vegetation-scattering\">植被散布</a> 与 <a href=\"../game-terrain-systems/foundations/terrain-pipeline\">地形管线</a>；密度噪声原理见 <a href=\"../procedural-content-generation/foundations/randomness-noise\">随机与噪声</a>；程序化生成的可控性见 <a href=\"../procedural-content-generation/foundations/controllability-evaluation\">可控性与评估</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"程序化散布","id":"程序化散布"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从密度到具体的点","id":"核心概念-从密度到具体的点"},{"level":2,"text":"密度场：哪里该长多少","id":"密度场-哪里该长多少"},{"level":2,"text":"Poisson 盘采样：让点既随机又不打架","id":"poisson-盘采样-让点既随机又不打架"},{"level":2,"text":"地形约束：坡度、高度、道路、水","id":"地形约束-坡度-高度-道路-水"},{"level":2,"text":"生态规则与实例属性","id":"生态规则与实例属性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"植被着色与次表面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/animation/foliage-shading"},"next":{"title":"植被 LOD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/practice/vegetation-lod"}}